{"guide":{"category":"events","categoryLabel":"生活活动","priority":"P1","featuredOnHome":false,"recommendedForCategories":["other"],"updatedAt":"2026-10-05","editionMonth":"2026-11","editionThroughDate":"2026-11-15","readMinutes":5,"slug":"san-francisco-autumn-food-markets-2026","title":"旧金山秋季市集：免费体验、买菜和收季日期","subtitle":"10月10日至11月12日，跟着已公布的 Foodwise 节目走","summary":"四个日期串起烘焙演示、秋果试吃、Mission 节庆和最后一场季节市集。分清免费节目、付费餐饮与不同帐篷。","emoji":"🍐","audience":["想逛本地市集的人","喜欢季节食材的家庭"],"tags":["农夫市集","季节食材","Foodwise"],"sourceNote":"2026年10月5日核对 Foodwise 活动和访客页。只列已公布日期；试吃不是免费正餐，摊位名单和供应会变化。","sources":[{"title":"Flour Craft 季节烘焙演示","url":"https://foodwise.org/events/heather-hardcastle-the-flour-craft-bakery-cafe-cookbook/","description":"10月10日 11:00–11:45"},{"title":"Mission 市集：亡灵节与万圣节下午","url":"https://foodwise.org/events/dia-de-los-muertos-and-halloween-at-mission-community-market/","description":"10月29日 15:00–19:00"},{"title":"Ferry Plaza 秋果品尝与墨西哥烘焙演示","url":"https://foodwise.org/events/fall-fruit-celebration/","description":"10月31日 11:00–13:00；演示11:00–11:45"},{"title":"Mission Community Market：2026收季最后一天","url":"https://foodwise.org/events/mission-community-market-last-day-of-the-season/","description":"11月12日 15:00–19:00"},{"title":"Mission Community Market","url":"https://foodwise.org/markets/mission-community-market/","description":"市场位置与访客说明"},{"title":"Tutuli cooking demo","url":"https://foodwise.org/events/sofia-jimenez-tutuli-mexican-bakery/","description":"10月31日11:00–11:45演示时段"}],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"把市集当半天生活体验：先选节目，再留一点时间买菜、休息。四条是不同日期的选择，不是同一天跨区赶场，也不保证试吃能解决午饭。"},{"type":"heading","text":"四个日期，各有重点"},{"type":"link","title":"Flour Craft 季节烘焙演示","text":"10月10日 11:00–11:45。演示免费；购书和市集购物另付。Heather Hardcastle 在渡轮大厦前分享烘焙与季节食材，演示后有食谱书签售。品尝属于演示安排，不代表提供免费正餐。","url":"https://foodwise.org/events/heather-hardcastle-the-flour-craft-bakery-cafe-cookbook/"},{"type":"link","title":"Mission 市集：亡灵节与万圣节下午","text":"10月29日 15:00–19:00。免费社区活动；摊位餐饮与购物另付。放学后参加手作、服装活动与季节食材体验；DJ Lamont 的音乐时段为17:00–19:00。传统面包、mole 等摊位食品需另购。","url":"https://foodwise.org/events/dia-de-los-muertos-and-halloween-at-mission-community-market/"},{"type":"link","title":"Ferry Plaza 秋果品尝与墨西哥烘焙演示","text":"10月31日 11:00–13:00；演示11:00–11:45。活动与试吃免费；市场购物另付。橙色帐篷可品尝秋果、取食谱、投票选喜欢的品种；同日11:00绿色 Classroom 帐篷有 Tutuli 的 Sofía Jiménez 烘焙演示。","url":"https://foodwise.org/events/fall-fruit-celebration/"},{"type":"link","title":"Mission Community Market：2026收季最后一天","text":"11月12日 15:00–19:00。逛市集；食材、餐饮和商品按摊位付费。Foodwise 明确11月12日是2026年最后一场，之后休季、计划2027年3月回归。适合补买季节食材，不额外承诺尚未公布的免费餐食或表演。","url":"https://foodwise.org/events/mission-community-market-last-day-of-the-season/"},{"type":"heading","text":"绿色帐篷看演示，橙色帐篷尝秋果"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ferry Plaza 的绿色 Foodwise Classroom 帐篷在渡轮大厦正前方。10月31日橙色 Seasonal Spotlight 帐篷的秋果活动11:00–13:00；绿色帐篷的 Tutuli 演示11:00–11:45，想看演示先按开始时刻到。"},{"type":"heading","text":"Mission 的街段与最后开市日"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当前访客说明是22nd Street 的 Mission 与 Valencia 之间，页脚仍保留84 Bartlett；按当前说明和现场指示找入口。11月12日15:00–19:00是已确认的2026收季场，之后不能继续套每周四开放。"},{"type":"checklist","items":["免费的是列明演示、手作或试吃；餐饮、商品与食谱书另付。","带购物袋、饮水和自行选择的预算；食物过敏先问配料。","出发前复查节目、摊位和天气；历史照片不保证当天货品。"]}]},"covers":{"zh-Hans":{"src":"/guides/distinct/ferry-market.webp","alt":"旧金山 Ferry Building 外的农夫市集摊位与行人","caption":"Ferry Building 农夫市集，2022 年 5 月资料照片；不是 2026 年 Foodwise 活动现场。","credit":"Suiren2022 · CC BY-SA 4.0","creditUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Farmers_Market_at_the_Ferry_Building_20220528_-_1.jpg","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","kind":"photo","width":1400,"height":1050,"srcSet":"/guides/distinct/ferry-market-small.webp 480w, /guides/distinct/ferry-market-800.webp 800w, /guides/distinct/ferry-market-1200.webp 1200w","lqip":"#899"}},"inline":[],"related":[{"slug":"bay-area-farmers-market-shopping-guide","title":"第一次逛湾区农夫市集：买回这一周真正会吃的东西","category":"events","sourceCount":3,"readMinutes":3,"covers":{"zh-Hans":{"src":"/guides/distinct/ferry-market.webp","alt":"旧金山 Ferry B